	(text "This will not be the actual power supply.\nNo LDOs will be used for final version!"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 260.35 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 194 0 194 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "3fc19934-38f9-4e45-a924-0fbfb966b580")
	)
	(text "**TPS2121 design**\n○ Requirements:\n • V_{IN1} = 14.8V nominal, within range 16.8V ~ 12.0V (4-cell LiPo)\n • V_{IN2} = 3.7V nominal, within range 5.0V ~ 3.0V (USB or backup LiPo)\n • I_{OUT_{(max)}} = 2A\n • C_{L} = 100uF\n • I_{INRUSH} = 100mA\n\nNote: USB will be used for debugging only, so calculations will consider backup\nLiPo voltage in IN2.\n\n○ XCOMP mode:\n • If V_{CP2} ≤ V_{PR1} => VOUT = IN1\n • If V_{CP2} > V_{PR1} => VOUT = IN2\n\nNote: for fast switchover mode, V_{CP2} must be higher than VREF (1.06V, typical),\nso 1.2V will be considered.\n\n○ Selecting PR1 and CP2 resistors:\n  V_{CP2_{(min)}} = 1.2V = 3.0V * R2/(R1+R2)\n    R1 = 150k\n    R2 = 100k\n    V_{CP2_{(max)}} = 1.68V (backup LiPo fully charged at 4.2V)\n\n  V_{PR1_{(min)}} ≤ 1.68V = 12.0V * R2/(R1+R2)\n    R1 = 1M\n    R2 = 160k\n    V_{PR1} = 1.66V ~ 2.32V\n\n○ Selecting OV1 and OV2 resistors:\n  V_{IN1_{(OV)}} = (16.8V + 1V) = VREF / (R2/(R1+R2)) => R2/(R1+R2) ≈ 0.05955\n    R1 = 1M\n    R2 = 63k\n    V_{IN1_{(OV)}} = 17.89V\n\n  V_{IN2_{(OV)}} = (5V + 0.5V) = VREF / (R2/(R1+R2)) => R2/(R1+R2) ≈ 0.19273\n    R1 = 270k\n    R2 = 64k\n    V_{IN2_{(OV)}} = 5.53V\n\n○ Selecting Current Limit resistors:\n  I_{LM} ≈ 2 = 65.2/(R_{LM}^{0.861})\n    R_{LM} = 56k\n    I_{LM} = 2.04 A\n\n○ Selecting Soft-Start capacitor:\n  SR_{ON} = I_{INRUSH} / C_{L} = 100m/100u = 1000 V/s\n  Considering VIN = 12V, CSS = 100nF will provide a Slew Rate of 800 V/s,\n  which is smaller than the calculated 1000 V/s, resulting in a current\n  inrush even smaller than the desired 100mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.05 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e55a9f83-1482-4e81-8fa4-1a7f4397942d")
	)
